WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.309
Today is the other letter. Only this one.

2
00:00:03.838 --> 00:00:06.417
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:13.076
Start today only if yesterday's letter is steady. If it is not, do yesterday's page again first.

4
00:00:13.526 --> 00:00:18.708
Here is the helper. Make the round part first. It is the letter that starts the word cat.

5
00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:21.549
Then go up, and come down.

6
00:00:22.927 --> 00:00:26.520
The round part comes first. So the round part is on the left.

7
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:31.880
The page tells you what to say out loud as you write. Use those same words every time.

8
00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:37.870
You write one big one. Then your child writes three with a finger on the table, saying it out loud.

9
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:43.929
Then your child traces and writes, and circles every one of these in the letter hunt. There are eight.

10
00:00:44.379 --> 00:00:48.346
At the end, your child writes the letter three times for you. Mark each one.
